      "rawText": "Observe the clinical video showing rhythmic horizontal eye oscillation. Diagnosis?\nA) Horizontal Jerk Nystagmus\nB) Opsoclonus\nC) Ocular flutter\nD) Saccades\nAns: A\nExp: Jerk nystagmus with slow drift.",
